    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Grumentum</span></b> , i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of
			Lucania</i>, near the modern <i>Saponara</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 23,
				37, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">27,
				41, 1</span></i> sq.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 6, 8, §
			69</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Grumentīni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Grumentum</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 11,
				15, § 98</span></i>.</div>
